WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Whispering Chasm - a bridge of dissolving light-fragments, urgent.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this bridge!

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.600 align:center
Kael: Promises... breaking.

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.900 align:center
Lyra: Almost there. Keep moving!

5
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Whispering Chasm - precarious ledge, desperate.

6
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.500 align:center
Lyra: The promise shard! It's here!

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Futile. It is ours now.

8
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.100 align:center
Kael: Hold onto it. Don't let go.

9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.400 align:center
Lyra: Mine! Get back!

10
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:32.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Whispering Chasm - collapsing ledge, dread.

11
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000 align:center
Lyra: The ledge! It's cracking!

12
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.300 align:center
Kael: Fall... always falls.

13
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.600 align:center
Lyra: No! Not the shard!

14
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:39.900 align:center
Lyra: Damn it! Move!

15
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:47.200 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth of 'What-Ifs' - a shifting maze of translucent walls, tense.

16
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.500 align:center
Lyra: Which way? It shifts!

17
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:50.800 align:center
Kael: Regrets... sharp edges.

18
00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.100 align:center
Lyra: Too many. Can't look.

19
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:58.400 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth of 'What-Ifs' - a collapsing corridor, urgent.

20
00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.700 align:center
Lyra: The corridor! It's collapsing!

21
00:01:00.1000 --> 00:01:02.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Accept your past. Become us.

22
00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.300 align:center
Lyra: Not like this! Never!

23
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:11.600 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Pit of Regret - surrounded by sharp shards, desperate.

24
00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:12.900 align:center
Lyra: Trapped! It's coming!

25
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.200 align:center
Kael: The light... use it.

26
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.500 align:center
Lyra: This one? My guiding light?

27
00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:18.800 align:center
Lyra: Get back! Away!

28
00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:24.100 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Ascending path - glowing, temporary, dread.

29
00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.400 align:center
Lyra: Go! The path... fading!

30
00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:28.700 align:center
Kael: Hold on... almost gone.

31
00:01:28.1000 --> 00:01:30.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A futile burst. We recover.

32
00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:38.300 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Plateau of Fading Echoes - overlooking a vast, fragmented landscape, tense.

33
00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:40.600 align:center
Lyra: Safe... for a moment.

34
00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:41.900 align:center
Kael: Nowhere... is safe.

35
00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We anticipated this. Your next move.

36
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:51.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Nexus of Forgotten Truths - a collapsing chamber, dread.

37
00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:52.800 align:center
Lyra: No! Cornered!

38
00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your truths. Known to us.

39
00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.400 align:center
Kael: They know... everything.

40
00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.700 align:center
Lyra: What do I do?

41
00:01:59.1000 --> 00:02:05.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Nexus of Forgotten Truths - point of sacrifice, desperate.

42
00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Give us your essence.

43
00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.600 align:center
Lyra: Not this one... please!

44
00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:11.900 align:center
Kael: Sacrifice... for life.

45
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.200 align:center
Lyra: No choice. Take it!

46
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:20.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Escape Corridor - unstable, dissolving, dread.

47
00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:21.800 align:center
Lyra: Gone... it's gone.

48
00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.100 align:center
Kael: Fading... my purpose.

49
00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We know where you run. Always.
